  idleFrameRate: 12
  description: "An aquatic, poisonous form that survives toxins and bends water to its will."
  transformationMethod: "As the Mage, drink Poison while Wet."
  transformationPotionSprites:
  - {fileID: 3833926529033503733, guid: 1a1694ee82ded3342bde68515610b0d6, type: 3}
  - {fileID: -517353636276603117, guid: 88bee5b2da11771489473878b514bbfb, type: 3}
  transformationHint: "As the Mage, drink in this order."
  cureMethod: "Drink a Dark potion to return to the Mage."
  immunePotionSprites:
  - {fileID: -2172864323747464720, guid: edab2cf6e83ce054aa717b7051e46c14, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 1358720898326617198, guid: 1a103b75ec8e47743b5cab6823f048c3, type: 3}
  spells:
  - nome: Water Zone
    costo: 1
    icona: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6d5e66595d498d84bb86f9f5e20b4712, type: 3}
    audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cfe7a0d49f07b40459112117ebfcd4a8, type: 3}
    descrizioneNormale: "Toggles the Water field. Activating it replaces any other elemental field and empowers PupperFish. Each toggle costs mana."
    descrizionePotenziata: "Same toggle and cost. Casting while Water is active switches the field off."
    descrizioneBreve: "Toggle the Water field to empower PupperFish."
  - nome: Eat Algae
    costo: 0
    icona: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d7a2a8145bd68b845a85d47848717296, type: 3}
    audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cfe7a0d49f07b40459112117ebfcd4a8, type: 3}
    descrizioneNormale: "Consumes all Algae and restores 2 MP per Algae level. Requires Algae."
    descrizionePotenziata: "With the Water field active: restores the same MP and also heals 2 HP."
    descrizioneBreve: "Eat Algae: +2 MP per level; +2 HP in Water."
  - nome: PufferFish
    costo: 6
    icona: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0521791b244e6f94a987517795167fd9, type: 3}
    audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cfe7a0d49f07b40459112117ebfcd4a8, type: 3}
    descrizioneNormale: "Activates a projection that destroys potions touching it. Its fifth non-Light potion raises light intensity by 1, once per activation."
    descrizionePotenziata: "With the Water field active: also restores 3 MP after paying the casting cost. The projection keeps the same destruction and light-reward rules."
    descrizioneBreve: "Project a potion-destroying fish; +3 MP in Water."

